From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mu0810 <Mu0810@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 10:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Tetris: touch: Add a HAL for the touch controller's game mode

Exposes the FocalTech driver's game mode (/proc/touchpanel/game_mode)
as LineageOS's IHighTouchPollingRate, which adds a "High touch polling
rate" switch to Settings > Display.

The driver resets the controller when the screen turns on and then only
restores glove, cover and charger mode, so the HAL watches
debug.tracing.screen_state and turns game mode back on after each
screen-on. Switching off only writes to the driver while game mode is
on, so with the switch unused the controller keeps its stock defaults.
